      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.46.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a river, the streams whereof shall make glad the city of God, the holy ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "place",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the tabernacles of the most High.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.46.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.46.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the midst of her; she shall not be moved: God shall help her, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " right early.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.46.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.46.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The heathen raged, the kingdoms were moved: he uttered his voice, the earth melted.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.46.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.46.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD of hosts ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with us; the God of Jacob ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " our refuge. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
